---
import { portalLinks } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="membership-section" id="membership" aria-labelledby="membership-title"><div class="container membership-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your professional community</p><h2 id="membership-title">Stay connected.<br /><em>Move forward together.</em></h2></div><div class="membership-copy"><p>Use the member portal to manage your profile and access membership services. If you are joining for the first time, start with the registration form.</p><div class="membership-actions"><a class="button button-cream" href={portalLinks.login}>Sign in to the portal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link light-link" href={portalLinks.register}>Start registration <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>
